1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,561
Every agent on your machine — Cursor, Codex,

2
00:00:03,561 --> 00:00:07,151
Workbuddy — spawns processes, rewrites files,

3
00:00:07,151 --> 00:00:08,268
opens sockets.

4
00:00:08,268 --> 00:00:10,299
AgentReins records all of it.

5
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:11,784
Process lineage.

6
00:00:11,784 --> 00:00:13,190
File mutations.

7
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,922
Network destinations.

8
00:00:14,922 --> 00:00:18,976
Everything lands in an append-only SQLite WAL,

9
00:00:18,976 --> 00:00:20,651
the evidence spine.

10
00:00:20,651 --> 00:00:22,005
But here is the limit.

11
00:00:22,005 --> 00:00:23,591
It records every action,

12
00:00:23,591 --> 00:00:25,508
and it can stop none of them.

13
00:00:25,508 --> 00:00:27,005
That is a monitor plane.
